Z||000001||Fret Naught||05-23-2000||06:41 PM||||Well, for what it is worth, I just paid 2000.00 for a 86 SE,V6 new paint real good shape interior was a bit dirty some cig. burns in the pass. seat. no electric acc. with 140K. on it. It was well maintained, and runs real good. I thought I got a deal. Too bad, I really wanted a red one. I personally would go as high as 4500.oo for one in the shape yours is in. It may be worth more I don't know. ||||reg||14
