Z||000006||Fret Naught||05-24-2000||05:40 PM||||4500.00 hum, I guess I wasn't far off, I think that you probably paid a fair price, and the seller got a fair price. That low milage is worth alot in my opinion. If you keep up on the preventive maintenance, it should be years before any major engine work is needed.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Haze_Performance||05-24-2000||06:43 PM||||I spend $2500 for a 1985 2M4 6 months ago. It had 36,000 miles(org)on it. It was loaded, auto with sunroof perfect shape in and out. A few days ago some guy in a gas station offered me $6000 for it, or $3500 and trade his 88 Fiero GT for it. ||||reg||14
